{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A short, cute, colorful 2D platformer inspired by the energy and exploration of Kirby's Adventure. The full release includes a round structure that borrows ideas from Star Fox 64 - you pick your path through a series of levels in pursuit of a high score. The levels themselves meanwhile blend the sprawling nature of Sonic 1's levels with the room-structure of Kirby's Adventure's levels.<strong> This demo will show off one of those levels. Can you find all its secret exits and secret characters?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Run</strong> through <strong>SHORT, SNAPPY</strong> levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build</strong> a team of four characters to take on the evil king. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pick</strong> your path through the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore</strong> each level with its many paths, looking for <strong>SECRETS</strong> around every turn.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3782060?t=1748785057","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3782060?t=1748785057","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782060/7d4d1fe840b39b1099b6404252ad1ffbff5ff767/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748785057","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782060/7d4d1fe840b39b1099b6404252ad1ffbff5ff767/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748785057","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A short, cute, colorful 2D platformer inspired by the energy and exploration of Kirby's Adventure. The full release includes a round structure that borrows ideas from Star Fox 64 - you pick your path through a series of levels in pursuit of a high score. The levels themselves meanwhile blend the sprawling nature of Sonic 1's levels with the room-structure of Kirby's Adventure's levels.<strong> This demo will show off one of those levels. Can you find all its secret exits and secret characters?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Run</strong> through <strong>SHORT, SNAPPY</strong> levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build</strong> a team of four characters to take on the evil king. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pick</strong> your path through the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore</strong> each level with its many paths, looking for <strong>SECRETS</strong> around every turn.</p>","developers":["Charlie Burke"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2836060","name":"Flame Land"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782060/6aae0f49973f9429f45cfbd4c4b83f64cedfd1e0/header.jpg?t=1748785057","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257147480,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257147480/movie480.mp4?t=1748785056","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257147480/movie_max.mp4?t=1748785056"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257147480/4f9ae9b55e432638f2a6cd1e9328bdf37219d5e5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748785056","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257147480/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748785056","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257147480/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748785056"}}],"nam